# Photo booth (R23 street/plaza, on theme): a tall ink booth with a half-drawn dark curtain, a cyan flash panel over the
# entry and a strip-print slot with a warm lamp. Faces +x.
grid 5
size 22 18 46
slot body Ink
slot trim Trim
slot curtain InkBrown
slot flash NeonCyan
slot edge NeonCyanEdge
slot lamp WindowDim
shell 0 0 0 22 18 42 2 body
carve box 20 3 2 22 15 38
box 20 3 2 21 9 38 curtain
box 0 0 42 22 18 44 trim
box 21 2 39 22 16 42 edge
box 21 3 40 22 15 41 flash
box 4 16 20 10 17 24 lamp
box 2 6 4 8 12 14 trim
